<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013300744/device-tp.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" style="width: 680px; height: 70px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks for your time on the phone.</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">As we discussed, the benefits of your Qantas Business Rewards membership include access to exclusive savings on the base fare of selected flights, discounted Qantas Club membership and more.</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Rewarding business travellers, like you</b>&nbsp;<br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 15px; margin: 0px; width: 199px; padding: 8px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><img alt="Access exclusive savings" title="Access exclusive savings" border="0" width="80" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2022292465/qf_q_icon_80x80.png" style="display: block; margin: auto;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><b><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Works with Frequent Flyer</font></b></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn Qantas Points for the business<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">1</sup>&nbsp;on top of the points and Status Credits you'll earn for the same eligible flight<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">2</sup>.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 15px; margin: 0px; width: 199px; padding: 8px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><img alt="Earn twice on flights" title="Earn twice on flights" border="0" width="80" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2022292462/qf_plane_icon_80x80.png" style="display: block; margin: auto;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><b><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Exclusive Flight Savings</font></b></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Access savings of up to 8% off the base fare on selected Qantas flights depending on your business' membership level<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">3</sup>.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 15px; margin: 0px; width: 199px; padding: 8px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><img alt="Earn points when spending" title="Earn points when spending" border="0" width="80" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013131377/Icon-qantas-club_80x80.jpg" style="display: block; margin: auto;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><br></font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><b><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Club Discount</font></b></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 20px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">As an employee of a business signed up for Qantas Business rewards you can save 20% on Qantas Club memberships<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">4</sup>.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><b><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Add your ABN</font></b></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Adding your business' ABN and Traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer number when making a flight booking will ensure your business does not miss out on earning Qantas Points. Here are some tips to remember your details:</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Save your ABN details to your phone.</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 2px 0px;"><img width="30" height="17" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2018913669/list-bullet-icon30x17.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 30px; height: 17px;"></div></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><div style="padding: 0px; margin: 4px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">If booking on&nbsp;<a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">qantas.com</a>&nbsp;select remember me.</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><b><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Accessing flight savings</font></b></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The account holder for your business' Qantas Business Rewards membership can provide you with access to book flights via our online booking tool or allow you to book via the Qantas App. Just ask for the 'Self Booking Feature' to be switched on against your profile.</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 65px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font><hr style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=69upFyxRBhY" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2024000119/180529+QBR+youtube.png" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 285px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 285px; vertical-align: top;"><b style="margin: 10px 0px 5px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Like to know more?</font></b></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 285px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=69upFyxRBhY" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">Watch our video</a>&nbsp;to learn how to get the most out of Qantas Business Rewards.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 65px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font><hr style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><b><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Need help with bookings or your account?</font></b></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">If you need further information about your account or bookings, please call the Qantas Business Rewards Service Centre on 13 74 78. Available 7am to 7pm AEST, Monday to Saturday.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br>Sincerely,<br>Your Qantas Business Rewards Team</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 45px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 10px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 23px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 23px; margin: 0px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">1. A business must be a Qantas Business Rewards Member and registered for GST or be an Australian Public or Private entity or other incorporated company, and not be a travel agent or on a Corporate Deal with Qantas to earn Qantas Points for the business. Qantas Points for business are offered under the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlineterms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas' Terms and Conditions</a>. Qantas Points earned on air travel are determined in accordance with the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/airlineearntable" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">airline earn table</a>. A Member's ABN and traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number must be quoted at the time of booking to earn Qantas Points for both the business and the traveller. An eligible flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia; is operated by Qantas, Emirates or American Airlines; has a ticket number commencing with '081'; and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Exclusions apply</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">2. You must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn Qantas Points and Status Credits. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions</a>. Qantas Points and Status Credits (where applicable) are earned on eligible flights with a Qantas or applicable&nbsp;<b>one</b>world® Alliance Airline or Airline Partner flight number on your ticket. Qantas Points and Status Credits may not be earned on some fare types and booking classes. See terms and conditions and the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/flying/airline-earning" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earning Tables</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">3. Savings are available exclusively to Qantas Business Rewards Members on selected fares only and do not apply to taxes, fees and carrier charges. Availability is limited. Other conditions may apply. Savings are subject to and defined in the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlinesavings" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;of Qantas Business Rewards as Member Savings.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">4. Discounted Qantas Club membership is available to Qantas Frequent Flyer members who are Qantas Business Rewards Flyers of the Qantas Business Rewards Member. The discount applies to the Qantas Club individual membership rates on new and subsequent memberships and is managed under the Qantas Club individually managed corporate scheme. Qantas Club membership is subject to the&nbsp;<a href="http://www.qantas.com/travel/airlines/qantas-club-terms-conditions" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Club Terms and Conditions</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>